%% Sequence: ROI Agregado de Flights (multi-dia: Day 1A, 1B, 1C -> Day 2 -> Final)
%% Spec: Docs/specs/tournament-types-extension-and-manual-add-fix.md (RF-05)
%% ADR-031: isFlight como modificador ortogonal - parent/child via flight_parent_id self-FK soft

sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Jogador
    participant UI as Pagina /analytics/flights/:parentId
    participant Query as TanStack Query (staleTime 5min)
    participant API as GET /api/flights/aggregate/:parentId
    participant Auth as requireAuth (JWT)
    participant Storage as getFlightAggregateROI(userId, parentId)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>UI: Acessa analytics do evento Flight<br/>(ex: BSOP Million Sao Paulo)
    UI->>Query: useQuery(['flight-aggregate', parentId])

    alt Cache hit (TTL 5min)
        Query-->>UI: Resposta cacheada
    else Cache miss
        Query->>API: GET /api/flights/aggregate/:parentId
        API->>Auth: validate JWT
        Auth-->>API: userId

        API->>Storage: getFlightAggregateROI(userId, parentId)

        Storage->>DB: SELECT * FROM tournaments<br/>WHERE id = ? LIMIT 1
        DB-->>Storage: parent row (Day 1 ancora)

        alt Parent nao existe ou isFlight=false
            Storage-->>API: null
            API-->>Query: 404 Not Found
            Query-->>UI: Error
            UI-->>User: Mensagem "Flight nao encontrado"
        else Parent valido (isFlight=true)
            Note over Storage: Index utilizado:<br/>idx_tournaments_user_flight_parent<br/>(user_id, flight_parent_id) partial WHERE flight_parent_id IS NOT NULL

            Storage->>DB: SELECT * FROM tournaments<br/>WHERE user_id=? AND<br/>(id = ? OR flight_parent_id = ?)<br/>ORDER BY date_played
            DB-->>Storage: allFlights[] (parent + filhos)

            Note over Storage: Particiona allFlights:<br/>day1Entries = filter(/^\d+[A-Z]$/.test(flightDay))<br/>(matches "1A", "1B", "1C")<br/>finalDay = find(flightDay='Final' OR /^\d+$/ != '1')<br/>(matches "Final", "Day 2", "Day 3")

            Storage->>Storage: totalInvested = sum(allFlights.buy_in)
            Storage->>Storage: totalWon = finalDay ? Number(finalDay.prize) : 0
            Storage->>Storage: roi = totalInvested === 0 ? 0 : (totalWon - totalInvested) / totalInvested
            Storage->>Storage: advancedCount = day1Entries.filter(d => d.flightAdvanced === true).length

            Storage-->>API: FlightAggregateROI shape

            API-->>Query: 200 OK + FlightAggregateROI
            Query->>Query: Cache (staleTime 5min)
            Query-->>UI: Resposta
        end
    end

    UI->>UI: Render card com:<br/>- eventName (parent.name)<br/>- day1Entries[] (cada Day 1 com buyIn + advanced)<br/>- finalDay {position, prize} ou null<br/>- totalInvested (sum buy-ins de todos Day 1 + Day Final)<br/>- totalWon (prize do Day Final)<br/>- ROI agregado (%)<br/>- advancedCount (quantos Day 1 avancaram)

    UI-->>User: Visualizacao consolidada

    alt Caso especifico: Re-entry entre 1A e 1B (mesmo evento)
        Note over User,DB: Cenario E2E:<br/>1. User joga Day 1A do BSOP Million com buy-in $1000.<br/>   Eliminado. Cria row 1: {flightDay:'1A', flightAdvanced:false, flightParentId:null, prize:0}<br/>2. Re-entra no Day 1B com buy-in $1000.<br/>   Sobrevive. Cria row 2: {flightDay:'1B', flightAdvanced:true, flightParentId:row1.id, prize:0}<br/>3. Joga Day Final, posicao 5, prize $5000.<br/>   Cria row 3: {flightDay:'Final', position:5, prize:5000, flightParentId:row1.id}<br/>4. getFlightAggregateROI(userId, row1.id) retorna:<br/>   - day1Entries: [row1 (advanced=false), row2 (advanced=true)]<br/>   - finalDay: row3<br/>   - totalInvested: $3000 (1000+1000+1000)<br/>   - totalWon: $5000<br/>   - roi: 0.667 (66.7%)<br/>   - advancedCount: 1
    end
